  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A marked rise in global nominal yields increases the cost of carry and strengthens the discount rate (and often the dollar), reducing speculative and demand-side support for oil and exerting downward pressure on crude benchmark prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">middle_east_maritime_con</data>
</edge>
