  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in sovereign yields raise public borrowing costs, prompting cuts or delays in maintenance and deterrent/upkeep programs that increase the vulnerability of critical infrastructure and thus the realized physical and functional damage during attacks.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
