  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Wider credit spreads raise borrowing and leasing costs for corporates, cloud providers and integrators, prompting them to defer or cancel purchases of AI accelerators and thereby reducing near‑term demand.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
