  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising public debt service pressures push governments toward fiscal consolidation and strategic protectionism, leading to tighter export controls, investment screening and regulatory hurdles affecting tech and AI hardware transactions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
