<edge source="china_taiwan_grayzone_pr::strategic_pressure" target="global_bond_market_shock::nominal_yield_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating coordinated economic, diplomatic and military pressure raises tail‑risk of wider conflict, prompting a flight‑to‑quality into core sovereign debt that increases demand and depresses nominal yields (especially at the short and intermediate maturities).</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">china_taiwan_grayzone_pr</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_market_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_taiwan_grayzone_pr::strategic_pressure" target="middle_east_maritime_con::corporate_operational_re" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating coordinated Chinese multi‑domain pressure (diplomatic, regulatory, commercial) on third‑country ports, insurers and service providers compels global energy and shipping firms to accelerate reflagging, contractual rerouting and contingency operations to preserve access and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">china_taiwan_grayzone_pr</data>
  <data key="d40">middle_east_maritime_con</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_taiwan_grayzone_pr::strategic_pressure" target="russia_ukraine_war::alliance_cohesion" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in China‑directed multi‑domain pressure force the US and its partners to reallocate diplomatic and military attention and assets toward the Indo‑Pacific, producing disputes over burden‑sharing and timetables that erode coordinated policy and resource commitments for supporting Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">china_taiwan_grayzone_pr</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_taiwan_grayzone_pr::strategic_pressure" target="us_china_tech_trade_riva::regulatory_tightness" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
