  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained uptick in low‑visibility PRC maritime and paramilitary activity around Taiwan forces U.S. and allied surface and air assets to prioritize the Indo‑Pacific, reducing visible escort/patrol presence in the Gulf and prompting insurers and operators to mark up risk for Middle East transits.</data>
