  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter Chinese enforcement of trade, payment and customs rules (e.g., stricter import licensing, payment-screening, or sudden restrictions) disrupts Chinese refiners' crude procurement and payment flows, causing cancelled or deferred shipments from Middle Eastern suppliers and lowering seaborne energy throughput.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
