  <data key="d37">Tighter Chinese export controls and enforcement against shipments of dual‑use components and industrial equipment to Russian firms directly reduce the flow of spare parts and critical inputs needed to repair and restore energy and communications infrastructure in Russia/occupied areas, lowering repair speed and capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
