  <data key="d37">An increase in investors' assessment of geopolitical and operational risk tied to China–Taiwan tensions raises required returns and tightens lending/underwriting standards, directly reducing the rate at which procurement‑specific finance (debt/equity) is provided for AI accelerator purchases.</data>
